Package: lexicon_file_conversions
Title: Convert FLEx LIFT Lexicons to and from CSV Tables
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Timothy", "Kempton", , "tim_kempton@sil.org", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Converts a SIL FieldWorks Language Explorer (FLEx) LIFT lexicon
    export into a set of tidy CSV tables (lift2csv), and builds a LIFT file
    back from those tables (csv2lift). The CSV data model is specified in
    SPEC.md.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Imports:
    argparser,
    devtools,
    dplyr,
    purrr,
    readr,
    stringr,
    tibble,
    tidyr,
    xml2
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0),
    withr
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.0
